  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=26>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_2
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER WIN</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=20>\n-  During Base Games, 5 or more Scatter symbols in any position
      triggers a Scatter Win.\n-  Each Scatter symbol awards a coin value ranging
      from 1 to 8 times the Total Bet.\n-  Total Scatter Wins is the sum of all Scatter
      symbols that appeared and triggered\n   the Bonus feature.\n-  In either Choose
      Your Bonus game, total win becomes a factor of the Total Scatter Wins\n   from
      Base Game spin that triggered the Bonus.\n        -  Free Games: Each Wild appearing
      in Free Games awards the Total Scatter Win\n           amount from Base Games.\n
      \       -  Bingo Game: Total Scatter Wins is added to calculate any Bingo line
      wins."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32>Mr. Goose's Free Games</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>Free Games Wild Multiplier</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=20>\n-  User may select Free Games when Choose Your Bonus is triggered.\r\n-
      \ In Free Games, Wild symbols appear on reels 2, 3, 4, and 5.\r\n-  Each Wild
      symbol is worth the Total Scatter Wins value from the\n   base spin that triggered
      the bonus. \r\n-  A Wild Multiplier is applied to the sum of Wild symbol pays
      and awarded in\n  addition to any line wins."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=20>\n-  Each time a spin has one or more Wild symbols, a Wild multiplier
      may be chosen.\n-  Multiplier is chosen randomly between 2x and 10x.\n-  The
      chosen multiplier is applied to the sum value of all Wild symbols in that spin.\n
      \  The multiplier does not apply to the line wins."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=32>Golden Eggs Bingo Game</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>Bingo Game Gift Boxes</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=20>\n-  User may select the Bingo Game when Choose Your Bonus is
      triggered.\n-  A 5x5 bingo card appears with 25 spots of randomly assigned numbers.\n-
      \ Mr. Goose randomly draws an egg.\n-  Corresponding eggs with identical numbers
      turn gold and reveal if they are\n   a credit prize or a multiplier.\n-  A bingo
      is won when there are 5 or more gold eggs in a straight line.\n-  Each winning
      bingo line awards: (Total Scatter Wins from base spin that triggered\n   the
      bonus + sum of credit values on the line) x (sum of multipliers on the line)."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: "<size=20>\n-  Each bingo card has randomly assigned gift boxes.\n-  If
      a player collects every spot on a gift box after winning a bingo line, an extra
      bonus\n   is awarded.\n-  If multiple gift boxes are collected, award the sum
      of all extra bonus."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_SUB_TITLE
    value: <b><size=24><color=#fc9109>PAYS   FREE SPINS
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_TEXT
    value: '<b><size=32>5

      4

      3'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=32><style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SCATTER_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FREE_SPINS
    value: '<b><size=32><style=coinColor> 20</style>

      <style=coinColor> 15</style>

      <style=coinColor> 10</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>25 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=18>\n-  Scatter symbol may appear anywhere\n   on the reels.\n-
      \ 5 or more Scatters in any position\n   triggers the Bonus Game."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER SYMBOL</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD SYMBOL</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=18>\n-  Wild symbols appear in\n   Free Games on reels 2, 3, 4,\n
      \  and 5."
